[en.FOCUS_C12_ENHANCE_CHEESE_CANNON]
Enhance Cheese’s Cannon

[en.FOCUS_C12_ENHANCE_CHEESE_CANNON_desc]
Currently, our research on artillery has reached the pinnacle across Equestria, enabling us to further enhance the Party Cannon previously invented by Cheese Sandwich, endowing it with even greater deterrence.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_ENHANCE_CHEESE_CANNON]
改良派对炮

[zh.FOCUS_C12_ENHANCE_CHEESE_CANNON_desc]
如今我们对火炮的研究在整个小马利亚都登峰造极，这让我们可以进一步改良此前芝士三明治发明的派对大炮，使其具有更加强大的威慑力。

